      },
      "message": "test(import): pin the .sc face names in the document; record D1-D3\n\nApp pins (crates/app/tests/import_solidcraft/source_faces.rs, joined\nto the import_solidcraft binary): a format-10 `.sc` import lands its\nnames with the facets (undo and redo); STL, OBJ and STEP models have\nnone; an update trades the names on undo and drops them when it does\nnot state them; a repair drops them and undo brings them back; a\ndeleted model comes back with them; names that do not tile, or that\nother facets landed over, are never handed out.\n\ndocs/decisions/3915-sc-face-names.md: D1 cache format 10 only, D2 the\nimport never fails because of names, D3 in memory only in this PR. A\nlater commit of this series gives the file the sub-issue number, 4212.\n\nBuilt and tested on the earlier base 773736856 (the PR body lists the\nruns). Rebased onto a721fd4dc without a local build; the maintainer's\nrunners test it.\n\nRefs #3915\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
