      "message": "test(import): run the hostile names cases on a six-face block\n\nThe hostile names run now uses a six-face block as the final body, with\nsix names of our own, so each of its 30 imports is quick and the run is\nbounded by the names, not by the sample's 53-face body. The base case\nmust read its six names, so every mutation reaches the names reader.\n\nBuilt and tested on the earlier base 773736856 (the PR body lists the\nruns). Rebased onto a721fd4dc without a local build; the maintainer's\nrunners test it.\n\nRefs #3915\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
