      "message": "docs(decisions): give the .sc face names decisions the sub-issue number\n\nThe decision file of this PR takes the number of its sub-issue:\ndocs/decisions/3915-sc-face-names.md becomes 4212-sc-face-names.md,\nand its D1-D3 headings read #4212. The one citation of the file, in\ncrates/kernel/src/solidcraft/names.rs, follows. No code change.\n\nRefs #3915\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
